Please check <a href="https://github.com/LMPrado-DZ23/dz23-tradingview-assistant/issues" target="_blank">GitHub issues</a> and open a new one if it is not reported yet. Include:
- extension version {0} and your browser;
- TradingView UI language;
- the console log: F12 → Console, filter "[tv-assistant]", levels including "Verbose".

